* ''The swarm moves into the Lararium'' (operator, 2026-11-07: //"after the Lararium stands we move these into the Lararium 'capability stack' either as parts of the product code, parts of the TS -> cjs tiddlywiki plugin code ('inside the VM code'), or as appropriate 'causal island shore connectors'. Then the daemon can drive it all from inside the Lararium."//). After standing, the multi-model swarm harness (today's `tools/` broker, walls, launcher, lane state, push grant, gate and land train) moves into the capability stack, each part to the home its nature names: product code, plugin code running inside the VM, or a shore connector across a causal-island boundary; the daemon then drives the swarm from inside the Lararium (#/the-order, rank 31; `L30`).

